{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/injuries/rucking-shin-splints-prevention-early-signs-and-recovery-pro","version_id":"c326a48b8e179a83b08b5738d25659335affea5b0b8b625a7a0189038beb4ced","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Uncertainty, the cited prevention review supplies usable evidence about insole effectiveness and the limits of cushioning and special socks, directly informing footwear choices for loaded miles without claiming rucking-specific validation. Commercial incentives warrant noting affiliate commissions, GORUCK-supplied review units, and high publishing volume; this supports Piece 03 with attributed research findings rather than product endorsements.","piece_ids":["03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/injuries/rucksack-palsy-numb-hands","version_id":"33e933df52c538cb87dd722a55fd3dcb7a1d574de307d1729f4a7f4e3232aa85","decision":"accept","reason":"Relevance, Credibility, and Suitability and official requirements support using the documented load-carriage review and military case series to explain strap padding, hip-belt fit, and shoulder-pressure tradeoffs during prolonged carrying. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, disclose affiliate earnings and GORUCK-supplied products, and preserve the article's distinction between proposed fit measures and unproved product-specific prevention claims; this supports Piece 03.","piece_ids":["03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/pillars/beginners-guide-to-rucking","version_id":"dbb0e18ebbe81172b08892d816f7c5dc4dd27593c9935d64ada046f1119e6046","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Credibility, Unsupported claims, and Making the decision, the gear advice is relevant but provides little substantive testing behind recommendations about plate placement, footwear, and blister prevention; brief references to separate reviews do not supply their findings. Commercial incentives further limit the recommendations' evidentiary weight because the publisher earns affiliate commissions and explicitly received the featured GORUCK review samples free.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/pillars/rucking-gear-guide","version_id":"422a275be764c64e3d288ba08b51fa52cc4b69ec3c6f2835a125f6bbcd8f5ae1","decision":"defer","reason":"Relevance covers its packs, footwear, and hydration gear, and Credibility permits using published dimensions as claimed specifications, but the central rankings and durability, comfort, and performance recommendations lack described comparative testing. Under Unsupported claims and Commercial incentives, defer pending stronger evidence, noting affiliate commissions, GORUCK-supplied review units, and the publisher's unusually high review volume.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/pillars/rucking-injury-prevention","version_id":"c4217dc00958b969dee299f020f05279a6cb4b2c1689eb0037f74829dfcbc32f","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Freshness and novelty and Making the decision, its supported hip-belt, strap-padding, and insole findings substantially repeat the more focused accepted items without adding distinct gear evidence. Credibility and Unsupported claims also limit its product-specific balm and recovery-tool recommendations; Commercial incentives require disclosure of affiliate links and the publisher's GORUCK-supplied review units.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/training/is-rucking-bad-for-your-back","version_id":"6be87287c01a788401892fd4eb4df37a774d39fa1698a9d7ceeebd53c7d6ec5e","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Conflicting evidence, the cited review of 47 heterogeneous studies and the described study of 15 loaded hikers provide specific evidence for questioning universal pack-height advice and evaluating suspension and hip-belt function. Uncertainty requires preserving the limits of military and short-term research, while Commercial incentives require noting affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied review units; the item supports Piece 03's practical fit checks without establishing product-specific injury protection.","piece_ids":["03"]}
